<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2695260054"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1762014563"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Moonlit Dream (Phonk)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="DLSS / Lunak / iphonk"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Moonlit Dream (Phonk)"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="02:13.875"><div begin="00:11.032" end="02:13.875"><p begin="00:11.032" end="00:14.009" itunes:key="L1">Glitchy hearts in moonlight</p><p begin="00:14.010" end="00:15.066" itunes:key="L2">Shadows dance no spotlight</p><p begin="00:15.067" end="00:17.057" itunes:key="L3">Broken dreams of starlight</p><p begin="00:17.058" end="00:20.005" itunes:key="L4">Whisper softly all night</p><p begin="00:20.006" end="00:22.031" itunes:key="L5">Lost in neon twilight</p><p begin="00:22.032" end="00:24.075" itunes:key="L6">Feel it deep in midnight<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">幽影徘徊身畔</span></p><p begin="00:24.076" end="00:27.022" itunes:key="L7">Broken beats we ignite</p><p begin="00:27.023" end="00:30.054" itunes:key="L8">Echoes in the half light</p><p begin="00:30.055" end="00:32.079" itunes:key="L9">We're spinning spinning around</p><p begin="00:32.080" end="00:39.075" itunes:key="L10">Hearts glitching glitching the sound<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">触摸鹅绒般的夜色</span></p><p begin="00:39.076" end="00:44.079" itunes:key="L11">Lost in the echo we found<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">彼此双手紧扣</span></p><p begin="00:44.080" end="00:50.006" itunes:key="L12">Love in the chaos unbound<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">灵魂开始交融</span></p><p begin="00:50.007" end="00:54.010" itunes:key="L13">Synthetic pulse in my veins<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">永远迷失在时光里</span></p><p begin="00:54.011" end="00:56.041" itunes:key="L14">We break the rules no refrains<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在暮光中徘徊</span></p><p begin="00:56.042" end="00:58.097" itunes:key="L15">Caught in electrical chains<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">落入这甜蜜的深渊</span></p><p begin="00:58.098" end="01:01.032" itunes:key="L16">Love's a glitch nothing remains</p><p begin="01:01.033" end="01:03.032" itunes:key="L17">Midnight whispers resonate</p><p begin="01:03.033" end="01:05.080" itunes:key="L18">Hearts collide and oscillate</p><p begin="01:05.081" end="01:08.063" itunes:key="L19">Lost in dreams that wont abate</p><p begin="01:08.064" end="01:10.076" itunes:key="L20">Echoes never dissipate</p><p begin="01:10.077" end="01:15.024" itunes:key="L21">We're spinning spinning around</p><p begin="01:15.025" end="01:20.011" itunes:key="L22">Hearts glitching glitching the sound</p><p begin="01:20.012" end="01:25.028" itunes:key="L23">Lost in the echo we found</p><p begin="01:25.029" end="02:13.875" itunes:key="L24">Love in the chaos unbound</p></div></body></tt>